WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:03.770
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.980
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world,</i>

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.480
<i>and my body transformed into an OP physique!</i>

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.250
<i>Our test proctor, Artoria-san, 
is predisposed to attracting calamities,</i>

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.110
<i>but she's a very kind person.</i>

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.580
<i>However, she's currently in danger!</i>

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:24.580
I got you both caught up in my misfortune.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.530
I'm sorry.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.570
Artoria-san!

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:30.680
Artoria-san.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.840
You two?

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.600
We're here to save you, Artoria-san!

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.850
Seiichi, Saria...

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.610
Artoria-san, are you okay?!

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.610
How did you two get in here?

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:54.490
Well, you see...

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.980
Artoria-san's in danger.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.540
Wh-What do we do?

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.380
Damn it!

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.400
This wall!

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:14.380
Huh?!

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:18.090
I hit it like I meant it, and it broke?!

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.430
But now we can get to Artoria-san!

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:25.670
Hold on tight, Saria!

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:26.690
Instant Movement!

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.760
And that's how we got here!

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.480
S-Seriously?

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.820
And the Black Dragon God?

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.490
Oh, that's probably him over there.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.870
We ran into him when we came in.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.070
Huh?!

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:44.800
Are you okay?

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.370
Seiichi, heal Artoria-san's wounds!

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:50.380
Right. Use this, Artoria-san.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.440
Seiichi...

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.880
Saria, watch Artoria-san for me.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.510
Sure! Good luck out there, Seiichi!

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:12.230
So you're the one who hurt Artoria-san?

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.200
Damned human!

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.490
Don't think you'll leave here alive!

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.940
No, I'm going to defeat you,

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.460
and we'll all go home together!

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.170
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.170
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:01.140
<b>The Calamity Bride</b>

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.800
Seiichi!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.260
Instant Movement!

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.270
Damned human!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.930
Your species is insufferably annoying!

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.020
Instant Movement!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.690
Conquering Claws!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:22.700
H-He's strong!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.880
Skill: Advanced Appraisal!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.810
Black Dragon God, Level 5,000?!

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.950
That's over twice Xeanos's level!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.560
Die!

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:33.530
Instant Movement!

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:37.630
That was close!

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.490
Then how about this?

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.400
Wha... M-My body is...

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.060
Seiichi!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:10.600
Why didn't my Bind Resistance 
and Absorb skills have any effect?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.970
I'll eliminate you along with that arrogance!

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:21.320
This is my most powerful spell, Hell Inferno!

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:24.840
The flames of hell will burn you to ash!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.970
That's huge!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.720
What do I about that?!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.090
Seiichi!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.850
Use the spell from when you fought me!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.390
Oh, right!

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:38.810
I'm not going to lose!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.400
Fall Disaster!

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:03.300
Wh-Why, you!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.540
I vowed that I would never lose

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:12.050
to another human!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.520
Instant Movement!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.800
Ultimate skill: Gale!

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:21.220
I won't let you!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:24.940
I'm not done yet!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.490
You're finished.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:34.110
<i>Move, move, move!</i>

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.360
<i>Intimidation Resistance acquired.</i>

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.330
What?!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.580
<i>Abundant Blossoming of Swords acquired.</i>

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:49.590
Ultimate skill: One With the Sword acquired.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.650
I-I'm going to lose again?

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:13.120
I just wanted to live happily... alongside him...

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:33.300
Why did the Black Dragon 
God hate humans so much?

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.700
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.230
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.700
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.270
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.440
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:41.840
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.200
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.790
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:45.310
Seiichi!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.230
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.320
Ow!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.470
I-I'm fine!

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:52.070
But you seemed kind of sad.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.890
Forget about me. How's Artoria-san?

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:00.540
The recovery herbs have her asleep 
right now, but she should wake up soon.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.340
That's good. Now we can all go home.

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.850
Yeah! But how do we get home?

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:07.570
Huh?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:12.030
I don't know how to get home!

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.640
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What do we do?!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:16.040
What do we do?!

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.510
Calm down!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:21.760
There might be something in here 
that'll let us escape this dungeon.

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:27.020
<i>You acquired Black Dragon God's 
Scale, Fang, Claw, and Bone.</i>

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.970
This is going to make me OP again, isn't it?

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.820
If I eat the Black Dragon God's Gem,

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.920
it'll improve my physical stats 
and the potency of all magic?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.040
Wow, tastes like soda.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:49.040
<i>Skill: Spatial Magic acquired.</i>

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.050
Spatial Magic?

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.340
Did I get this magic from 
that treasure chest?

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:56.570
Saria, we can get home!

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.530
Really?! Yay!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.890
Black Conqueror's Long Coat.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.440
It has great impact and blade resistance,

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:12.750
so most common weapons will 
be unable to even scratch it.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.280
Wow! You look great in that, Seiichi!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.860
R-Really?

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.620
So this is the last item...

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.190
<i>Black Dragon God's Biography</i>.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.350
<i>Long, long ago,</i>

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:36.260
<i>the Black Dragon God was the 
guardian deity of a human land.</i>

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.790
<i>However, the humans</i>

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:42.100
<i>longed to create weapons from the 
Black Dragon God's powerful materials,</i>

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:46.270
<i>so one day they began 
to plot his subjugation.</i>

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:51.270
<i>The one who saved him from 
that fate was the Demon Lord!</i>

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.940
<i>However, the humans conducted 
their Hero Summoning,</i>

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.950
<i>and the Demon Lord was slain.</i>

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:02.950
<i>The Black Dragon God was 
sealed in his dungeon,</i>

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.950
<i>and he vowed to exact vengeance on mankind...</i>

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:10.960
<i>all to ensure he would never lose 
anything precious to him again.</i>

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.290
<i>The end.</i>

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.470
I'm so sorry!

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:22.260
Seiichi, are you okay?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.090
Y-Yeah.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:26.380
Mr. Sheep didn't show up this time, huh?

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.190
Huh? Now that you mention it, yeah...

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:33.510
<i>A Showa-era gag?</i>

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.200
Hello, Mister Sheep here.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.510
<i>I figured.</i>

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:43.000
It's from Mr. Sheep?! Read it, read it!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.500
Let's see...

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.010
Congratulations on clearing the dungeon.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:50.250
I'm glad to see you're steadily 
leaving your humanity behind!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.040
Shut up!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:56.220
This time, you failed to meet the condition 
of having the Black Dragon God live

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.260
peacefully alongside the Demon Lord.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.470
That's too difficult a challenge.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:05.640
Oh, don't look so sad just because 
you didn't see me for a while.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.470
Shut up!

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:11.660
Now, please continue working 
hard on clearing dungeons.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.910
Mister Sheep sounds like he's doing well.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:15.900
There's something else written here.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:19.120
P.S. I'll be going on vacation for a while,

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.580
so please refrain from 
actually clearing dungeons!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:22.860
Baa!

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.280
Do your job!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:28.000
I hope he enjoys his vacation.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.160
Anyway, we can finally go home.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.550
Yay, we're here!

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.550
It feels like it's been forever.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.060
Looks like Artoria-san's doing okay, too!

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:50.590
Then let's get back to our guild.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:51.550
Yeah!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.930
Put me down!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.990
Hey, please don't struggle!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:02.110
Put me down!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.510
We can't. Your wounds may have healed,

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.830
but you haven't recovered your stamina.

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:10.580
Sorry...

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.310
for getting you caught up in my misfortune.

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.210
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.670
Look. This is my Status.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:19.820
Your Luck is...

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.420
Negative two million?!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.460
"The Bearer of Calamity"...

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:26.950
From the moment I was born,
I've been cursed with that title.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.150
Oh, no...

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.920
That's sad enough,

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:33.870
but it brings misfortune 
to those around me as well,

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.750
and that's even sadder.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.440
Is there a way to break the curse?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.640
No.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:42.440
So I'll continue to bring 
misfortune to everyone around me.

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:46.450
I don't think you brought us misfortune!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.450
I feel the same way.

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:58.210
Oh! Artoria-kun! Seiichi-kun! Saria-kun!

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:00.710
What's everyone doing?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:04.440
Why, we were gathering 
all kinds of information!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.720
Wh-Why?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.220
To find our missing friends, obviously!

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.220
Friends...

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:16.480
I'm truly glad, though.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.740
You guys...

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:24.620
Artoria-san, it looks like everyone you 
thought you brought misfortune to

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.430
is happy.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:30.970
You're not some calamity.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:33.910
You just attract a little bit of trouble.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.370
Seiichi...

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.180
Neither Saria nor I,

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.800
nor anyone else at the Guild, 
is worried about your predisposition.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.800
We all love everything about Artoria Gremm!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.600
Huh?!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.360
Why is she running away?

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:58.310
Seiichi, chase after her!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.400
G-Got it!

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:09.320
Bel-san, I'm celebrating my new baby. 
Give me 50K.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.580
What?! That's too much!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:17.590
Man, those humans sure come up 
with some interesting things.

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:18.570
You know,

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:21.920
I heard this game was brought here by 
the heroes summoned from another world.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.350
Another world, huh?

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.510
I wonder what it's like.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.550
The Black Dragon God was defeated.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.220
Huh?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.290
Th-The Black Dragon God?!

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.460
Impossible!

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:37.360
He was the strongest being 
in the Demon Lord's army,

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:40.130
aside from the Demon Lord himself!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:44.860
Who defeated him?

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.900
I don't know, but...

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:51.860
it's clear that someone who opposes 
us Demons has shown themselves.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.870
What the heck kind of person is it?

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:57.850
Where did she go?

00:14:57.850 --> 00:14:59.370
Oh, right!

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.880
My, if it isn't Seiichi-san.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.380
Oh, Adrianna-san.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:11.130
What is it?

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.910
Um, I'm looking for Artoria-san.

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.210
Have you seen her?

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:18.320
Hmm... No, I haven't.

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:19.930
I see.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.380
Hey, Seiichi-san,

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.340
do you know about 
Artoria-chan's predisposition?

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.650
Well, yes.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.150
Then could I ask you a favor?

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.660
Huh? What is it?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:34.160
Could you get closer to her, 
even if it's only a little bit?

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.110
Of course.

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:40.160
Artoria-san is precious to me, after all.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.040
Well, I'll be going, then.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.200
I'm counting on you, Prince Charming.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:55.800
This is...

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.290
<i>...where we had our first guild test.</i>

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.190
Artoria-san.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.710
Seiichi.

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:23.750
What are you doing?

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.900
Hey, Seiichi... Am I...

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:30.180
really someone who's needed by others?

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:32.720
You saw everyone's 
expressions earlier, right?

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:36.220
They all love you, Artoria-san.

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:38.760
I'm so glad.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.110
I see.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:43.620
So just as I find everyone 
around me precious,

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:48.300
they consider me precious to them, as well.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:53.090
<i>She asked me to get closer to her...</i>

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:55.280
<i>but how?</i>

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.040
It's all right.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:03.240
If you're feeling anxious, \I'll be here beside you,

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.290
for as long as it takes to reassure you.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:09.250
I'll stay with you for as long it takes,

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:13.550
until the day you can truly 
smile from the heart.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.650
I wonder if Seiichi's okay.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.260
You don't have to worry about him!

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.440
My muscles tell me so!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.820
Setting what this trash heap says aside...

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:39.460
That's mean, Eris-kun!

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:40.460
Don't worry!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:44.590
Seiichi-san's kindness is definitely 
getting through to Artoria-san.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.720
Seiichi...

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:57.160
<i>Wait, am I...</i>

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.340
<i>doing something incredibly bold here?</i>

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.070
<i>No, calm down.</i>

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:05.230
<i>You're doing this out of kindness 
to help ease Artoria-san's fears!</i>

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:10.730
<i>Ah, but Artoria-san has such a nice smell...</i>

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.180
<i>Wait, no!</i>

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:14.300
<i>What am I doing relaxing around her?!</i>

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.740
S-Seiichi...

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:17.990
Huh? Er, yes?

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.360
U-Um... well...

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.260
Uh, that was embarrassing...

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:25.440
It was embarrassing for me, too!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:27.500
B-But thank you.

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:32.620
<i>It's so wrong that someone this 
kind bears a curse of misfortune!</i>

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:37.510
<i>Is there nothing I can do for her right now?</i>

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:44.260
From the moment I was born, 
I've been cursed with that title.

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:49.440
<i>If only Artoria-san's Luck 
wasn't in the negatives...</i>

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.400
<i>If it wasn't negative?</i>

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.560
<i>That's it!</i>

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.400
Artoria-san! Please hold out your hand!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.530
Huh?

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.410
<i>It should have the opposite 
effect on Artoria-san!</i>

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:10.560
What's this?

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.000
The Ring of Happiness.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:18.670
It's a Fantasy-grade item that will 
negate your curse and double your Luck.

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:21.680
Negate my curse and double my Luck?

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:22.850
Yes!

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:27.310
Your Luck will go from negative two 
million to positive four million!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.180
Which means your curse will be undone!

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:31.520
Wha... Really?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.700
You'll no longer be the Calamity.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.560
Artoria-san!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:40.700
Let's enjoy happiness worth all the 
misfortune you've faced so far!

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.700
I'll fully support you!

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:51.240
<i>I'll fully... fully... fully...</i>

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:00.090
Huh? Again?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.840
What did I do wrong?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.030
Let's enjoy happiness!

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:12.520
I'll fully support you!

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.510
I just proposed, didn't I?!

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.780
B-But thank you.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:29.790
But if it makes Artoria-san happy, then...

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.710
I guess that's good enough for now.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:48.770
Why is my heart racing like this?

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:57.630
What's wrong with me?

